sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Admin + CSRF
  participant W as Flask API
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant C as Control Worker
  participant B as MQTT/TLS Broker
  participant D as Device Agent + SQLite
  U->>W: Authorized target profile request
  W->>P: Durable transition + PREPARE command
  W-->>U: HTTP 202 (request saved)
  C->>P: Claim command
  C->>B: HMAC PREPARE
  B->>D: PREPARE
  D->>D: Validate + durable command ledger
  D->>B: HMAC READY
  B->>C: READY
  C->>P: Authenticated READY + ACTIVATE command
  C->>B: HMAC ACTIVATE
  B->>D: ACTIVATE
  D->>D: Atomically persist profile + ACK ledger
  D->>B: HMAC DEVICE_APPLIED ACK
  B->>C: ACK
  C->>P: Store authenticated report; effective waits for AEAD evidence
